ich, do you know why Mastermind is so eager to capture M4A1? "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Right now, it looks like she considers that to be more important than even the survival of Sangvis Ferri itself."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Persica","expression":3,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"NPC-Ange","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"background","value":"BG_Inner","raw":"BIN"}],"speaker":"Persica","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I've been looking into the matter myself, and I've got a few thoughts on the subject..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Persica","expression":3,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"NPC-Ange","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"background","value":"BG_Inner","raw":"BIN"}],"speaker":"Ange","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Such as?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Persica","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"NPC-Ange","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"background","value":"BG_Inner","raw":"BIN"}],"speaker":"Persica","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Lyco. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Do you still remember him?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Persica","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"NPC-Ange","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"background","value":"BG_Inner","raw":"BIN"}],"speaker":"Ange","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I do. He developed Mastermind and he's arguably the man behind it all... At least, that's how it appears on the surface. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"What does that dead man have to do with M4A1?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Persica","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"NPC-Ange","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"background","value":"BG_Inner","raw":"BIN"}],"speaker":"Persica","narrator":false,"pages":[{"